Error: Jet.InvalidStatement: A write window can't be a changeable name
  --> Tests/UI/write_window_is_not_a_changeable_name.jet:2:6
    |
  2 |     ^slot: xs[0].in_place()
    |      ^^^^
 Why: A window writes into the place it was made from, and can't be pointed at another place
 Fix: Remove the `^` before the name
